comment.narrative:
This indicator measures the number of subprojects reported by a district council as completed, aligned to the Annual Plan, and verified by the PMU.&nbsp;

Fourteen local councils are collectively reported to have completed (24 practically completed and 2 fully completed) 90% of capital investment sub-projects for Round 1

Note: data relates to Round 1/YR 1 though the update is for YR 2

&nbsp;
